## Residual covariate checklist (probe every AAR + Monday deep)
Before attributing a residual to “player form,” check and note presence/absence of:
1. Weather (wind, precip, cold, heat)
2. Roof / dome vs outdoor
3. Referee / crew tendencies (if published; else UNKNOWN)
4. Crowd / 12th-man / hostile environment
5. Travel / short week / international site
6. Game script (blowout, chase, backup QB, pace)
7. Backup / emergency QB environment for pass catchers (W1 London/Pitts lesson)

If a covariate was knowable pre-lock and ignored, log it as a process miss in `results/sigma/aar/`. If unknowable, mark UNKNOWN — do not invent.

